<<
/A 2122 0 R
/Alt (Stacked bar chart showing the number of studies by algorithm type from 2016 to 2025. Green bars indicate rule-based only, yellow indicates machine learning, and red indicates GenAI and LLMs. Studies increased over time, with GenAI and LLMs emerging from 2023 onward. 2024 shows the highest total with ten studies, distributed as one rule-based, four machine learning, and five GenAI and LLMs. 2025 has eight studies with four each for machine learning and GenAI and LLMs. Legend included for color identification.)
